{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H65cWFkU2ggAK5maXm9qEM","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# Pixel Engine API (v0.46.0)\n5:## Sections\n23:## 1. Engine and games\n25:### ADAPTIVE_ASPECT\n33:### type AspectMode\n39:### BUILTIN_MODELS\n47:### chunkyResolution()\n55:### clearScene()\n63:### computeFraming()\n69:### countObjects()\n77:### type DebugAction\n87:### type DebugKeyChanges\n95:### type DebugKeyMap\n101:### type DebugKeysOption\n114:### DEFAULT_DEBUG_KEYS\n122:### disposeObject()\n132:### class Engine\n197:### ENGINE_VERSION\n203:### interface EngineOptions\n226:### FPS_OPTIONS\n232:### class FrameLimiter\n242:### frameView()\n253:### interface Framing\n266:### interface Game\n288:### interface GameContext\n305:### interface HeadlessOptions\n312:### class LoadingScreen\n323:### loadSettings()\n331:### normalizeSettings()\n339:### optionsFromUrl()\n352:### PIXEL_SIZES\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n372:### QUALITY\n381:### QUALITY_LEVELS\n387:### QUALITY_OPTIONS\n393:### type QualityLevel\n407:### type QualityOption\n413:### interface QualitySettings\n418:### rebindDebugKeys()\n428:### interface Resolution\n446:### RESOLUTIONS\n452:### resolveDebugKeys()\n460:### class Settings\n479:### interface SettingsHost\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n507:### storeSettings()\n513:### urlSettings()\n523:### interface Viewport\n531:### withUrlOptions()\n542:## 2. Camera\n544:### CAMERA_PRESETS\n550:### interface CameraConfig\n566:### type CameraPreset\n577:### class CameraRig\n604:### interface CameraRigState\n617:### createCameraRig()\n623:### class FirstPersonRig\n637:### class FreeRig\n655:### class OrthoRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n677:## 3. Rendering, looks and filters\n679:### AMOUNT\n687:### applyFilter()\n696:### applyFilters()\n704:### type BackendName\n712:### interface CapturedFrame\n718:### clampParam()\n726:### cloneLook()\n732:### DEFAULT_EDGES\n738:### DEFAULT_PIXEL\n744:### defaultLook()\n752:### defaultParam