: readonly [number, number]`: Grid quads along x and z (default: one per ripple cell, or 4 per metre without ripples).\n5078-- `waves?: readonly Wave[]`\n5079-- `ripples?: RippleField | null`: A ripple field covering the same rectangle (its size and centre must match).\n5080-- `deep?: number`: Colours (hex): troughs, crests, foam.\n5081-- `shallow?: number`\n5082-- `foam?: number`\n5083-- `foamAt?: number`: Height above rest (m) where foam starts. Default: 75% of the waves' combined height (the tallest crests).\n5084-- `opacity?: number`: 1: opaque; less: see-through by a 4×4 ordered dither per art pixel.\n5085-\n5086-### class WaterSurface\n5087-\n4310:### interface GrassOptions\n4311-\n4312-- `area: readonly [number, number]`: Width (x) and depth (z) of the patch, m.\n4313-- `at: readonly [number, number, number]`: Centre of the patch on the ground.\n4314-- `count: number`\n4315-- `height?: readonly [number, number]`: Blade heights (m): shortest and tallest. Default [0.25, 0.55].\n4316-- `width?: number`: Blade width at the root (m). Default 0.07.\n4317-- `base?: number`: Colours (hex): roots and tips.\n4318-- `tip?: number`\n4319-- `mask?: (x: number, z: number) => boolean`: Where blades grow (world x, z); default everywhere in the patch.\n4320-- `ground?: (x: number, z: number) => number`: Ground height under a blade (default: the patch's y).\n4321-- `seed?: number`\n4322-\n4323-### groundFog()\n4324-\n4598:### interface PrecipitationOptions\n4599-\n4600-- `kind: PrecipitationKind`\n4601-- `count: number`: Most drops at once (the instance count).\n4602-- `area?: readonly [number, number, number]`: Width, height and depth of the air the drops fall through, around the centre.\n4603-- `color?: number`: Drop colour (hex).\n4604-- `speed?: number`: Fall speed (m/s). Rain 16, snow 1.4.\n4605-\n4606-### interface Recording\n4480:### interface MirrorOptions\n4481-\n4482-- `size?: readonly [number, number]`: Width and height of the glass (m). Default [4, 2].\n4483-- `tin