am.'],\n    3: ['A true warrior. Please don\\'t look at me like that.', 'In. Out. Perfect. I am writing a small poem about it.'],\n    first: ['The breath bar is new. So, it appears, is breathing.'],\n    repeat: ['Back to war. The war is still in the pavilion.'],\n  },\n  chair: {\n    0: ['You sat on a chair that isn\\'t there. Then you fell off it.', 'Nobody asked for this chair. Nobody is pleased.'],\n    1: ['An adequate chair. I wouldn\\'t leave a coat on it.', 'It got harder at the end. It does that. So does everything.'],\n    2: ['A good chair. Firm. A little judgmental. I like it.', 'You held that longer than most furniture.'],\n    3: ['I would sit on you. I can\\'t sit. But I would.', 'Coach nodded. I have only seen that twice.'],\n    first: ['That chair has been waiting a long time. Sorry about it.'],\n    repeat: ['You chose the chair again. Nobody asked. Again.'],\n  },\n  fold: {\n    0: ['You folded. Not in the correct sense.', 'Everybody folds in the end. You were early.'],\n    1: ['Your return has been received. It will be looked at.', 'A partial fold. The rest of you is under review.'],\n    2: ['Neatly filed. Your hamstrings have been informed.', 'A tidy fold. I have seen accountants do worse.'],\n    3: ['Immaculate. You may claim that as a deduction.', 'Fully folded and on time. I am almost emotional.'],\n    first: ['Your first Tax Season. There will be others. Annually.'],\n    repeat: ['Tax Season again. It comes round. It always comes round.'],\n  },\n  plank: {\n    0: ['The floor made an offer. You accepted.', 'A short negotiation. The floor was very reasonable.'],\n    1: ['You held out a while. The floor is prepared to wait.', 'A plank. Roughly. In parts.'],\n    2: ['Tough negotiating. Your elbows want it in writing.', 'A strong plank. The floor is impressed. It told me.'],\n    3: ['The floor has withdrawn. I have never seen that happen.', 'Thirty-five seconds of pure refusal. Lovely.'],\n    first: ['Your first plank. The tremble at the end is contractual.'],\n    repeat: ['You are back at the table. The floor brought biscuits.'],\n  },\n  squats: {\n    0: ['You did some squats of some kind. I saw them.', 'Regret: considerable. Squats: fewer.'],\n    1: ['Down, then up. You have the shape of it.', 'You regret that now. You will regret it more on the stairs.'],\n    2: ['Very nice. Your knees wrote to me, and it was short.', 'Good depth. Good tempo. Regret within normal limits.'],\n    3: ['Flawless. I wish I had knees. I\\'d only disappoint them.', 'Coach said \"Again.\" That is applause, here.'],\n    first: ['\"Last one.\" You believed her. They all do, the first time.'],\n    repeat: ['Twelve reps. She said ten. She will always say ten.'],\n  },\n  lunges: {\n    0: ['An apology should go in the direction you were asked.', 'I don\\'t think either leg accepted that.'],\n    1: ['Left, right. Sincerity will come with practice.', 'You apologised to your left side twice. It noticed.'],\n    2: ['A good apology. Both knees say they\\'ll think about it.', 'You lunged like you meant it. Nearly.'],\n    3: ['Both legs have forgiven you. It won\\'t last.', 'I have rarely seen anyone so sorry, so evenly.'],\n    first: ['Lean to the side it asks for. You got there eventually.'],\n    repeat: ['Sorry again. This is healthy. I think.'],\n  },\n  press: {\n    0: ['The mortgage has not moved. The bank is watching.', 'You looked at it for a while. So did I.'],\n    1: ['You lifted it a bit. Interest applies.', 'A small repayment. Your shoulders disagree.'],\n    2: ['You\\'re paying that off nicely. Mind your back.', 'A steady press. The bank would like a word, kindly.'],\n    3: ['Paid in full. Overhead, and on time.', 'That was heavy, and you made it look like paperwork.'],\n    first: ['It is heavier than it looks. Most commitments are.'],\n    repeat: ['Another payment. Only twenty-four years to go.'],\n  },\n  hoop: {\n    0: ['The hoop has been on the sand for some time.', 'You stood in a hoop. That is a start. It isn\\'t much of one.'],\n    1: ['The hoop went round. You mostly did not.', 'June says you\\'re doing your best. She said it very slowly.'],\n    2: ['A sound economy. Your hips are running a surplus.', 'Round and round. I got a little dizzy for you.'],\n    3: ['Four hoops. I am told that is a market correction.', 'June looked up. June has never looked up.'],\n    first: ['June will throw more hoops. Catch them. Or don\\'t. She knows.'],\n    repeat: ['Back in the hoop. It has missed you. It hasn\\'t.'],\n  },\n  step: {\n    0: ['There was music. There were feet. They never met.', 'You stepped. The song did something else.'],\n    1: ['Your feet are in the same class as the beat now.', 'Left, right. You were close to both of them.'],\n    2: ['Very rhythmic. Dennis is holding his side, but very rhythmic.', 'You kept time. Time has thanked you.'],\n    3: ['Every step. I could set a clock by you. I may.', 'Marguerite clapped once. Be careful.'],\n    first: ['Those are your feet. Now you\\'ve met, you can work together.'],\n    repeat: ['Same song, same step. That is what a class is.'],\n  },\n  header: {\n    0: ['The coconuts all landed. On the sand, thankfully.', 'Use your head, I said. Next time, I\\'ll say which part.'],\n    1: ['You headed several coconuts. I\\'m told you\\'re fine.', 'Dennis is winning. Please reconsider everything.'],\n    2: ['A strong forehead. It speaks well of you.', 'Dennis has stopped being fine. Well done.'],\n    3: ['Dennis would like you to stop now. He said so, from the sand.', 'Remarkable. Please see someone about it.'],\n    first: ['Flip-flops are not coconuts. This will be on the test.'],\n    repeat: ['Dennis reloaded. He says it\\'s personal. It isn\\'t.'],\n  },\n  slackline: {\n    0: ['The lagoon is lovely. You will have noticed.', 'You and the line have agreed to see other people.'],\n    1: ['You crossed. Quite wetly, but you crossed.', 'You got to the other side. Kevin got there first.'],\n    2: ['Nicely balanced. A little damp on the character.', 'Hardly a splash. The lagoon sends its regrets.'],\n    3: ['Dry all the way. Kevin was disappointed.', 'You walked on a string. Nobody here can say that but you.'],\n    first: ['Stopping is allowed. It is, in fact, the only skill.'],\n    repeat: ['Back on the line. The water remembers you.'],\n  },\n  tray: {\n    0: ['They are all still on the tray. Or the floor.', 'Vitamins work better inside you, I\\'m told.'],\n    1: ['Some of those are in cups. Well done, those ones.', 'Your wrists have been noted. That\\'s all I can say.'],\n    2: ['A sensible dose. Nothing on the floor worth mentioning.', 'Steady hands. Steady enough for most things.'],\n    3: ['Every one, in its cup. You may work in a pharmacy.', 'All accounted for. I counted them twice, for pleasure.'],\n    first: ['Tilt the tray, not the vitamins. You\\'ll see what I mean.'],\n    repeat: ['Another board. They are not getting any rounder.'],\n  },\n  jog: {\n    0: ['Coach went round alone. She has asked me not to mention it.', 'You jogged in the sense that you went outside.'],\n    1: ['You kept her in sight, at points. It\\'s a small island.', 'You were overtaken by a scooter. At a walking pace.'],\n    2: ['You nearly kept up. She slowed down for a sandwich.', 'A good steady pace. Your stitch sends its love.'],\n    3: ['You kept up. She has never been kept up with.', 'A perfect lap. The scooter is thinking about its choices.'],\n    first: ['Left, right. Not left, left. Left, left is a stumble.'],\n    repeat: ['Round again. It\\'s the same island. I checked.'],\n  },\n  pier: {\n    0: ['You did enter the water. Nobody can take that away.', 'The judges have put down their paddles. Softly.'],\n    1: ['A jump. In most respects. The judges were kind.', 'You landed. Water is very forgiving. Judges less so.'],\n    2: ['A strong entry. The judges conferred. Twice.', 'That was far. I could barely read it from here.'],\n    3: ['The judges stood up. One of them is crying.', 'You reached the buoy. We did not know we had a buoy.'],\n    first: ['You have three attempts. The first one is for the fish.'],\n    repeat: ['Back to the pier. The water hasn\\'t gone anywhere.'],\n  },\n  stand: {\n    0: ['You stood. Sort of.'],\n    1: ['You stood. Mostly. There was weather.'],\n    2: ['You stood through all of that. I saw it. I was there.'],\n    3: ['You stood, and nothing moved you. Nothing. Not even Kevin.'],\n    first: ['You may blink.'],\n    repeat: ['You stood again. Nobody asked. I am very glad.'],\n  },\n};\n\n/** Barks while you play. */\nexport const BARKS = {\n  ringIn: ['There you are.', 'Thank you.', 'That\\'s the circle.', 'Lovely. Stay.', 'Good. Again. That was also good.'],\n  ringOut: ['That is outside.', 'I\\'ll just note that.', 'Your left knee has wandered off. Please collect it.', 'You have left the circle. It misses you. It doesn\\'t.', 'I only counted the ones you noticed.'],\n  streak: ['You haven\\'t moved in some time. I have checked.', 'That was almost dull. Well done.', 'I am running out of things to say. Good.'],\n  fall: ['The water is noted.', 'Falls cost points and dignity.', 'I\\'m sure that was the plan.', 'The floor has never once let go.', 'That is one fall. I have stopped rounding down.'],\n  coachRandom: ['Good. Again. That was also good. Again.', 'I am eighty-one. I say this so that you feel something.', 'Hold.', 'Your form is your own. I would like that noted.', 'Breathe in. Not like that.'],\n};\n\n/** Ounce, following you around the island. */\nexport const ISLAND_BARKS = [\n  'Have you been stretching? Please don\\'t lie. I\\'m very sensitive.',\n  'Kevin has been with us eleven years. He has never once held a pose.',\n  'Please stay on the island. The rest is sea.',\n  'You walk very confidently, for someone with your ankles.',\n  'I hop because I have no legs. You have legs. Think about that.',\n  'The volcano is dormant. Mostly. It is on a programme.',\n  'That hammock has ended more days than you have.',\n  'You looked at the sea for a moment there. It\\'s not an exercise.',\n  'I could do this all day. I do do this all day.',\n  'Marguerite ran here this morning. From the mainland.',\n  'Do say hello to Dennis. Not too loud. It\\'s just the one leg.',\n  'Your posture has been forwarded to the relevant department.',\n  'June is twelve. June has never been out of breath. June is fine.',\n  'Today\\'s tile count is correct. I check it for pleasure.',\n  'The Sweat Jar is a metaphor. It is also a jar.',\n  'Everything here starts at zero. That is the island\\'s motto. Isn\\'t it?',\n];\n\n/** Jumping, waving and sitting have no purpose. They are noted anyway. */\nexport const IDLE_BARKS = {\n  jump: ['That didn\\'t need to happen. I saw it anyway.', 'A jump. Unprescribed.', 'You came back down. That\\'s the only way it works.'],\n  wave: ['Hello. I can see you. I\\'m right here.', 'I have nothing to wave with. I appreciate the thought.', 'Kevin doesn\\'t wave. Kevin has never waved.'],\n  sit: ['You\\'re sitting. It isn\\'t a pose. I\\'m writing it down as a pose.', 'A rest. Nobody earned it. Enjoy.'],\n};\n\n/** Reveal, after the Wobble Age rolls. %A is the age. */\nexport const AGE_LINES = {\n  first: ['Your Wobble Age is %A. Is that close? No? I\\'m so sorry.'],\n  worse: ['Your Wobble Age is %A. That has gone up. I am sure there is a reason.', 'Today you are %A. Yesterday you were younger. It happens to everyone, but less.'],\n  same: ['Your Wobble Age is %A. No change since yesterday. Which is, in a way, consistent.', '%A again. You are nothing if not reliable.'],\n  better: ['Your Wobble Age is %A. That is lower. Excellent! ...Compared to Dennis.', 'Today you are %A. Please don\\'t let it go to your knees.'],\n  feel: ['You said you felt %F. I have you at %A. I\\'m so sorry. It\\'s not binding.'],\n};\n/** Weigh-In greetings by day. */\nexport const MORNINGS = [\n  'Good morning. You look rested. I can\\'t see. But you felt rested.',\n  'Have you been stretching? Please don\\'t lie. I\\'m very sensitive.',\n  'Good morning. Please step on me.',\n  'Back again. The dial has been warmed for you. That\\'s a lie. It\\'s a dial.',\n  'Good morning. Let\\'s see what\\'s changed. Gently.',\n  'I have been looking forward to this. I look forward to everything. I have to.',\n  'One more. I am a little nervous today. I can\\'t think why.',\n];\n/** The delivery of \"Ow.\" varies. */\nexport const OW_LINES = ['Ow.', 'Ow.', 'Ow!', 'Ow...', 'Ow. Thank you.', 'Ow. Good morning.', 'Ow? No. Ow.'];\nexport const OW_JOKE = 'That was a joke. I can\\'t feel pain. I can only keep records.';\n\nexport const INTRO_LINES = [\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'Hello! I\\'m Ounce. Please step on me.', mood: 'pleased' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'Ow.', mood: 'alarm' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'That was a joke. I can\\'t feel pain. I can only keep records.', mood: 'smug' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'This dot is you. Keep it in the circle.', mood: 'neutral' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'That\\'s it. That\\'s the game. Everything else is decoration.', mood: 'pleased' },\n];\nexport const FERRY_LINES = [\n  { at: 1, until: 5, text: 'Tare Island. Everything here starts at zero.' },\n  { at: 5.5, until: 9.5, text: 'A wellness resort. Population: five, and a seagull.' },\n  { at: 10, until: 14, text: 'You have booked a week. Nobody remembers asking you to.' },\n];\nexport const CONCERNS = [\n  'Today\\'s concern: your ankles. I\\'ve been concerned all night.',\n  'Tomorrow\\'s concern: your left hip. It looked at me.',\n  'Tomorrow\\'s concern: posture. Yours. In general.',\n  'Tomorrow\\'s concern: that noise your knee makes. I have it on file.',\n  'Tomorrow\\'s concern: whether you\\'re really breathing or just nearby air.',\n  'Tomorrow\\'s concern: your shoulders. They have started to talk.',\n  'Tomorrow\\'s concern: me. I don\\'t want to discuss it.',\n];\nexport const REPORT_LINES = {\n  beatDennis: 'dennis: You beat me. It\\'s fine. It\\'s just the one leg.',\n  beatJune: 'june: You beat me. I\\'m pacing myself.',\n  beatMarguerite: 'marguerite: You beat me, dear. Enjoy it. I certainly won\\'t.',\n  noGoal: 'You did not fill the prescription. I have told no one. I told Coach.',\n  goal: 'Prescription filled. Five Drips. Coach is pleased, in the sense that she said nothing.',\n  empty: 'A short day. A very short day. I have rounded it up to a day.',\n};\nexport const HAMMOCK_LINES = {\n  ask: 'End the day? You have done nothing. That is your right.',\n  early: 'You have not finished Coach\\'s prescription. Nobody is cross. I will just be here, knowing.',\n  fine: 'A good day. Lie down. I\\'ll keep your numbers warm.',\n};\nexport const STATION_REMARKS = {\n  pavilion: 'Holding Still. It sounds easy. It sounds easy to everyone.',\n  shed: 'Reps. They said ten. They always say ten.',\n  beach: 'Beat Beach. The hoops are free. Everything else has a cost.',\n  lagoon: 'Lagoon Games. Please stay out of the lagoon, unless the game requires it.',\n  gate: 'A lap of the island. It\\'s further than it looks. It\\'s an island.',\n};\nexport const LONG_STAND_LINES = {\n  start: 'Stand.',\n  kevin: 'Kevin is on your head. He is staff. Carry on.',\n  sneeze: 'dennis: Sorry. Sorry. It\\'s just the one nose.',\n  applaud: 'Ignore her.',\n  june: 'Are you nearly done?',\n  blink: 'You may blink.',\n  kevinOff: 'Kevin has left. He said nothing. He never does.',\n};\nexport const CONFESSION = [\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'Thank you, everyone. Please stay where you are. I have a short announcement.', mood: 'concern' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'I have been a scale here for a long time. You trust me. It is why you come.', mood: 'droop' },\n  { who: 'marguerite', text: 'Go on, dear.' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'I have been adding seven.', mood: 'droop' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'To everyone. For years.', mood: 'droop' },\n  { who: 'june', text: 'I\\'m twelve. You said I was nineteen.' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'It felt motivating.', mood: 'concern' },\n  { who: 'dennis', text: 'So my leg is...' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'No, Dennis. The leg is real.', mood: 'neutral' },\n  { who: 'coach', text: 'You were leaning.' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'I was leaning. I am sorry. Let me correct your records.', mood: 'droop' },\n];\nexport const CONFESSION_AFTER = [\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'There. That is your real week. It is still yours.', mood: 'neutral' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'You were always seven years better than I said. I thought you should know.', mood: 'pleased' },\n  { who: 'coach', text: 'Good. Again.' },\n];\nexport const CREDITS_SIGNOFF = 'See you tomorrow. Bring your knees.';\nexport const WEEK2_LINES = [\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'Good morning. Week two. I am adding nothing now. I check it twice.', mood: 'pleased' },\n  { who: 'ounce', text: 'Everything is open. Stay as long as you like. Nobody has ever left.', mood: 'smug' },\n];\nexport const ATTRACT_LINES = [\n  'This is a recording. The person in it is doing better than you.',\n  'This person has never wobbled. This person is not real.',\n  'Please do not attempt this without a scale.',\n  'Everything you see here is optional. Except the scale.',\n  'Results not typical. Results not, in fact, recorded.',\n];\nEOF\ncat > src/core/week.js <<'EOF'\n// The rules of the week, as pure functions on a slot.\nimport { ACTIVITIES, CLASSMATE_SCORES, DRIP_BONUS, HARD_DAY, PLAYABLE_IDS } from '../data/activities.js';\nimport { AGE_OFFSET, DAILY_GOALS, DAYS } from '../data/week.js';\nimport { MILESTONES } from '../data/unlocks.js';\nimport { T } from './tunables.js';\n\nexport const dayData = (slot) => DAYS[(slot.day - 1) % DAYS.length];\n\nexport function goalOf(slot) {\n  if (slot.week === 1) return dayData(slot).goal;\n  return DAILY_GOALS[(slot.day - 1 + (slot.week - 2) * 3) % DAILY_GOALS.length];\n}\n\n/** Is this activity open today? */\nexport function isOpen(slot, id, allUnlocked = false) {\n  if (allUnlocked || slot.unlockedAll || slot.week > 1) return true;\n  const def = ACTIVITIES[id];\n  return slot.day >= def.day;\n}\nexport const hardOpen = (slot, allUnlocked = false) => allUnlocked || slot.unlockedAll || slot.week > 1 || slot.day >= HARD_DAY;\n\nexport function starsFor(def, score, extra = {}) {\n  const k = T.starThresholdScale;\n  if (def.stars === 'custom') return extra.stars ?? 0;\n  if (def.stars === 'percent') {\n    const max = Math.max(1, extra.max ?? 100);\n    const pct = (score / max) * 100;\n    return def.starPct.filter((p) => pct >= p * k).length;\n  }\n  return def.stars.filter((s) => score >= s * k).length;\n}\n\nexport function dripsFor(stars, seconds) {\n  return Math.round((2 + 3 * stars + Math.floor(seconds / 30)) * T.dripRate);\n}\n\nexport function goalMet(slot, goal = goalOf(slot)) {\n  const today = slot.todayDone;\n  switch (goal.kind) {\n    case 'poseAndOne': return today.some((d) => ACTIVITIES[d.id]?.family === 'pose') && new Set(today.map((d) => d.id)).size >= 2;\n    case 'stars': return today.some((d) => d.stars >= goal.n);\n    case 'newThing': return today.some((d) => d.firstEver);\n    case 'count': return new Set(today.map((d) => d.id)).size >= goal.n;\n    case 'beatDennis': return today.some((d) => d.beat?.includes('dennis'));\n    case 'beatJune': return today.some((d) => d.beat?.includes('june'));\n    case 'beatMarguerite': return today.some((d) => d.beat?.includes('marguerite'));\n    case 'stand': return today.some((d) => d.id === 'stand');\n    default: return false;\n  }\n}\n\n/** Write a finished activity into the slot. Returns what happened. */\nexport function applyResult(slot, id, { score, stars, seconds, hard = false }) {\n  const def = ACTIVITIES[id];\n  const prior = slot.records[id];\n  const firstEver = !prior;\n  const rec = prior ?? { best: 0, stars: 0, plays: 0, hardBest: 0 };\n  const newBest = score > rec.best;\n  rec.plays++;\n  rec.best = Math.max(rec.best, score);\n  rec.stars = Math.max(rec.stars, stars);\n  if (hard) rec.hardBest = Math.max(rec.hardBest ?? 0, score);\n  slot.records[id] = rec;\n\n  const others = CLASSMATE_SCORES[id] ?? {};\n  const beat = Object.keys(others).filter((k) => score > others[k]);\n  const newlyBeat = beat.filter((k) => !(slot.beaten ??= {})[k]?.[id]);\n  for (const k of beat) ((slot.beaten[k] ??= {})[id] = true);\n\n  const metBefore = goalMet(slot);\n  slot.todayDone.push({ id, stars, score, firstEver, beat });\n  slot.todaySeconds += seconds;\n  slot.todayStars += stars;\n  let drips = dripsFor(stars, seconds);\n  let bonus = 0;\n  if (!slot.goalPaid && !metBefore && goalMet(slot)) { bonus = DRIP_BONUS; slot.goalPaid = true; }\n  drips += bonus;\n  slot.drips += drips;\n  slot.todayDrips += drips;\n  const unlocked = awardMilestones(slot);\n  void def;\n  return { drips, bonus, firstEver, newBest, beat, newlyBeat, unlocked };\n}\n\nexport function awardMilestones(slot) {\n  const out = [];\n  while (slot.milestone < MILESTONES.length && slot.drips >= MILESTONES[slot.milestone].drips) {\n    const m = MILESTONES[slot.milestone];\n    slot.wardrobe.push(m.id);\n    (slot.todayNew ??= []).push(m.id);\n    out.push(m);\n    slot.milestone++;\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n\n/** T in 0..1 from today's test. Wobble Age from the last three. */\nexport function ageFromTests(tests, totalStars) {\n  const last = tests.slice(-3);\n  const mean = last.length ? last.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / last.length : 0;\n  const base = Math.round(20 + 60 * (1 - mean)) - Math.min(20, totalStars * T.ageTrainingWeight);\n  return Math.max(18, Math.min(95, Math.round(base)));\n}\nexport const totalStarsOf = (slot) => Object.values(slot.records).reduce((a, r) => a + (r.stars ?? 0), 0);\nexport const shownAge = (slot, trueAge) => (slot.confessed ? trueAge : trueAge + AGE_OFFSET);\n\n/** Morning: file today's test. Returns { trueAge, shown, previous }. */\nexport function recordWeighIn(slot, T01) {\n  slot.tests.push(T01);\n  const trueAge = ageFromTests(slot.tests, totalStarsOf(slot));\n  const previous = slot.ages.length ? slot.ages[slot.ages.length - 1] : null;\n  slot.ages.push(trueAge);\n  return { trueAge, shown: shownAge(slot, trueAge), previous: previous === null ? null : shownAge(slot, previous) };\n}\n\nexport function startDay(slot) {\n  slot.todayDone = [];\n  slot.todayStars = 0;\n  slot.todaySeconds = 0;\n  slot.todayDrips = 0;\n  slot.todayNew = [];\n  slot.goalPaid = false;\n}\n\nexport function nextDay(slot) {\n  startDay(slot);\n  slot.day++;\n  if (slot.day > 7) { slot.week++; slot.day = 1; }\n  slot.phase = 'morning';\n}\n\nexport function nextActivity(id, slot, allUnlocked) {\n  const station = ACTIVITIES[id].station;\n  const list = PLAYABLE_IDS.filter((a) => ACTIVITIES[a].station === station);\n  const i = list.indexOf(id);\n  for (let k = 1; k <= list.length; k++) {\n    const next = list[(i + k) % list.length];\n    if (!slot || isOpen(slot, next, allUnlocked)) return next;\n  }\n  return id;\n}\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Write the line bank and week rules","timeout":30000}}}
