 kept per second (0..1). Default 0.35.\n1916-\n1917-### ropeBridge()\n1918-\n1919-```ts\n14-8. Audio: `attenuation`, `AudioManager`, `AudioSettings`, `Instrument`, `Listener`, `muffleCutoff`, `noteFrequency`, `parseSong`, `PLAYGROUND_SONG`, `PlayOptions`, `renderSound`, `SFX`, `SfxName`, \n15-9. Particles: `BurstOptions`, `ParticlePool`, `ParticlePreset`, `ParticlePresetName`, `Particles`, `PARTICLES`\n16-10. HUD: `Hud`, `HudAnchor`, `HudColor`, `HudOptions`, `hudPlace`\n17-11. Models and textures (ASSETS.md): `addModelColliders`, `around`, `assetProgress`, `AssetReader`, `BakedTexture`, `bakeTexture`, `boxFrame`, `buildModel`, `Catalog`, `CatalogEntry`, `checkModel`,\n18-12. Animation toolkit: `analyzeClip`, `ClipDef`, `ClipReport`, `compileClip`, `compileClips`, `Foot`, `FootGoal`, `gaitClip`, `gaitPartners`, `GaitSpec`, `Key`, `LegDef`, `LegStepper`, `LegStepperO\n19-13. Hero kit: `HERO_CLIPS`, `HERO_MODEL`, `HERO_RAGDOLL`, `HERO_RIG`\n--\n2242:### applyDeadzone()\nok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EP1cbXigDX4qm4Xu3PoLVf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
