{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjRDizz5zxmUZnVhoLtv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook is right that I never did a line-by-line check against PLAN §21, so I'm doing that now and saving the evidence in `PROGRESS.md`.\n\nTwo of its points look off, and I'll verify both instead of assuming: I removed the `void` placeholders in the cleanup, and this machine has three browser engines, not four.\n\nRe-reading the plan, I can already see gaps of my own:\n- `tools/clip-sheet.mjs` was never written.\n- `check.mjs` was never run.\n- The Holding Still frame check was never done.\n- The PlayStation and Xbox glyphs and the session card were never looked at.\n\nFirst comes an audit script."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3704,"cache_read_input_tokens":725359,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3704},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"59675b37-0bd8-4f77-bcdd-1d6a7bf7c6b3","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:53:49.560Z","request_id":"req_011CgjRDiJKXf3JATjQws2Bj"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjRDizz5zxmUZnVhoLtv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GPph2NBaytXMaFR9D4eRRP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='../PROGRESS.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns+=\"\"\"\n## Completion audit against PLAN (in progress)\nStop hook asked for a full check against PLAN 21. Work list: clip-sheet tool + look at poses; check.mjs on html and --sheets; Holding Still frames; glyphs/card/About screens looked at; plan samples verbatim; menu row rules; Timeline in ending; Jog length; every scene status+fingerprint; browser layout test. Tick table goes here when done.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n(timeout 110 npm install --no-audit --no-fund --silent </dev/null 2>&1 | tail -1); mkdir -p .scratch\necho \"--- void / TODO / stub scan (src, tools, tests)\"; grep -rnE \"\\bvoid [a-zA-Z_]|TODO|FIXME|XXX|stubbed|lorem\" src tools tests --include=*.mjs --include=*.js | grep -v \"credits-text\" | cut -c1-110\necho \"--- architecture files from PLAN 16 that are missing\"\nfor f in src/main.js src/app.js src/core/{dot,drivers,actions,device,tunables,save,net,clock}.js src/ui/{font,menu,dialogue,widgets,prompts}.js src/audio/{voice,songs,sfx}.js src/art/{avatar,models,textures,clips,glyphs,portraits}.js src/data/{title,activities,poses,reps,charts,boards,week,lines,questions,unlocks,classmates,stations,medley,about}.js src/scenes/{base,boot,title,attract,hub,weighin,report,locker,records,jar,card,medley,join,ending}.js src/scenes/activity/{base,poses,reps,hoop,step,header,slackline,tray,jog,pier,longstand}.js tools/{build,test,clip-sheet,shot}.mjs; do [ -f \"$f\" ] || echo \"MISSING $f\"; done\necho \"--- plan's sample lines not found verbatim\"\ncat > .scratch/samples.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { allLines } from '../src/data/alllines.js';\nconst all = allLines().map(l=>l.text);\nconst blob = all.join(' | ');\nconst samples = [\"Hello! I'm Ounce. Please step on me.\",\"Ow.\",\"That was a joke. I can't feel pain. I can only keep records.\",\"How old do you feel? This is not binding.\",\"Your Wobble Age is %A. Is that close? No? I'm so sorry.\".replace('%A','68'),\"Thank you. I have written that down.\",\"You wobbled 14 times. I only counted the ones you noticed.\",\"Your left side is doing very well. I'll let your right side know.\",\"No change since yesterday. Which is, in a way, consistent.\",\"Excellent! ...Compared to Dennis.\",\"I'm not angry. Scales don't get angry. We get accurate.\",\"Have you been stretching? Please don't lie. I'm very sensitive.\",\"Today's concern: your ankles. I've been concerned all night.\",\"Good morning. You look rested. I can't see. But you felt rested.\",\"Kevin has been with us eleven years. He has never once held a pose.\",\"This is a recording. The person in it is doing better than you.\",\"I have been adding seven. To everyone. For years. It felt motivating.\",\"See you tomorrow. Bring your knees.\",\n\"You are a tree. A tree does not check its phone.\",\"Your left knee has wandered off. Please collect it.\",\"Breathe in. Not like that.\",\"Good. Again. That was also good. Again.\",\"Hold. You may blink on Thursday.\",\"I am eighty-one. I say this so that you feel something.\",\"Stillness is a muscle. So is regret. We train both here.\",\"The floor is your friend. It has never once let go.\",\n\"Both hips, new. Knee, new. Opinions, original.\",\"I used to do this professionally. Not this. Something near it.\",\"It's fine. It's just the one leg.\",\"I'm pacing myself.\",\"My gran says you're doing your best. She said it very slowly.\"];\nfor (const s of samples) if (!blob.includes(s)) console.log('  missing:', s);\nconsole.log('total lines in bank', all.length, 'samples', samples.length);\nprocess.exit(0);\nEOF\ntimeout 40 node .scratch/samples.mjs </dev/null 2>&1 | cut -c1-120\necho \"--- line lists exported but never read by game code\"\nfor name in AGE_LINES ATTRACT_LINES BARKS CONCERNS CONFESSION CONFESSION_AFTER CREDITS_SIGNOFF FERRY_LINES HAMMOCK_LINES INTRO_LINES IDLE_BARKS ISLAND_BARKS LONG_STAND_LINES MORNINGS OW_JOKE OW_LINES REPORT_LINES RESULT_LINES STATION_REMARKS WEEK2_LINES HOLD_LINES; do c=$(grep -rl \"\\b$name\\b\" src --include=*.js | grep -v \"data/lines.js\\|data/alllines.js\\|data/poses.js\" | wc -l); [ \"$c\" = 0 ] && echo \"  unused: $name\"; done\ngrep -n \"coachRandom\" -r src --include=*.js | grep -v \"data/lines\" | cut -c1-90; echo \"--- scenes without their own status/fingerprint\"\nfor f in src/scenes/*.js src/scenes/activity/*.js; do case $f in *base.js|*index.js|*sets.js|*attract.js|*events.js|*lanes.js) continue;; esac; st=$(grep -c \"  status(\" $f); fp=$(grep -c \"  fingerprint(\" $f); [ \"$st\" = 0 -o \"$fp\" = 0 ] && echo \"  $f status=$st fingerprint=$fp\"; done; echo done","description":"Audit placeholders, plan file list, sample lines and scene hooks","timeout":170000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3704,"cache_read_input_tokens":725359,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3704},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"0ee8e759-e25f-46a8-9f6e-89c57deba697","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:54:05.979Z","request_id":"req_011CgjRDiJKXf3JATjQws2Bj","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01GPph2NBaytXMaFR9D4eRRP":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\npython3