{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjVd84feoMN9wxyFBiVR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The audit found everything fine except that on the Podium, Ounce's remark covers the Rematch menu, so I'll hold that menu until she finishes, then update the feedback and run the full suite.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3935,"cache_read_input_tokens":936129,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3935},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"0d9411bb-e460-44e9-9f56-bd51469af9e8","timestamp":"2026-11-05T08:50:27.625Z","request_id":"req_011CgjVd7XRgQEXqTYVsthhL","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjVd84feoMN9wxyFBiVR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017qdtbQUZSi6fttLhV9hnr6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ndef sub(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (p, a[:90])\n        s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\nsub('src/scenes/medley.js',[\n(\"\"\"    if (this.phase === 'podium' && this.menu) this.menu.update(ctx, 0);\"\"\",\"\"\"    // The menu waits for Ounce to finish her remark, which sits where the menu goes.\n    if (this.phase === 'podium' && this.menu && !this.bark.active) this.menu.update(ctx, 0);\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    if (this.menu) {\n      this.menu.o.y = Math.max(38 + this.order.length * 12 + 12, hud.height - 74);\n      this.menu.draw(ctx);\n    }\n    promptBar(hud, App.device, [['confirm', 'Select']]);\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (this.menu && !this.bark.active) {\n      this.menu.o.y = Math.max(38 + this.order.length * 12 + 12, hud.height - 74);\n      this.menu.draw(ctx);\n      promptBar(hud, App.device, [['confirm', 'Select']]);\n    }\"\"\"),\n])\nsub('tests/headless/systems.mjs',[\n(\"\"\"  s.menu.items.find((i) => i.id === 'rematch').action();\"\"\",\"\"\"  eq(App.bark.active, true, 'Ounce is talking');\n  layout.record = true;\n  h.step(2);\n  assert(!layout.rects.some((r) => r.name === 'menu'), 'the menu waits for her');\n  await h.until(() => !App.bark.active, { every: 10, max: 60 * 15 });\n  h.step(2);\n  assert(layout.rects.some((r) => r.name === 'menu'), 'then it shows');\n  layout.record = false;\n  s.menu.items.find((i) => i.id === 'rematch').action();\"\"\"),\n])\nsub('src/data/about.js',[\n(\"\"\"    'About 60. Scripts caught about 20 (a crash, a dead activity, ghost messages that never reached other players, a save field lost on reload, and balance). Screenshots caught about 35 that scripts could not see (avatars vanishing, a dial hiding Ounce, prompts under dialogue). A line-by-line audit against the plan caught the rest (sample lines not verbatim, menus over the row limit, no Timeline in the ending).',\"\"\",\"\"\"    'About 70. Scripts caught about 30 (a crash, a dead activity, ghost messages that never reached other players, a save field lost on reload, a click that could not jump, hoops dropping before Go, and balance). Screenshots caught about 35 that scripts could not see (avatars vanishing, a dial hiding Ounce, prompts under dialogue). A line-by-line audit against the plan caught the rest (the 12 px safe margin, sample lines not verbatim, menus over the row limit, no Timeline in the ending).',\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    'Five. Step Class avatars vanished from a bad ease name. Avatars folded into heaps from a lean that added up every frame. Vitamin Tray scored 0 for everyone because resting bodies slept through gravity changes. Step Class crashed on a mat colour. Online, ghosts never received their messages.',\"\"\",\"\"\"    'Seven. Step Class avatars vanished from a bad ease name. Avatars folded into heaps from a lean that added up every frame. Vitamin Tray scored 0 for everyone because resting bodies slept through gravity changes. Step Class crashed on a mat colour. Online, ghosts never received their messages. Pier Jump could not be jumped with a mouse. Clicking on the island walked to the wrong place.',\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    'Running five bot skills through every activity. In one command it found a crash and a dead activity, and it gave every balance number I tuned against. The 1920x1080 contact sheets were a close second.',\"\"\",\"\"\"    'Scripts that play every activity through real keys, a real stick and a real mouse. Bots skip the input layer, so only these could find that a mouse could not jump at Pier Jump. Next came the bot sweep, which found a crash and gave every balance number, and the 1920x1080 contact sheets.',\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    'Say whether Header solo has classmates, and give the unit for bias. Ask for contact sheets of every screen as a step, since they caught more than I expected.',\"\"\",\"\"\"    'Say whether Header solo has classmates, and give the unit for bias. Ask for contact sheets of every screen as a step, and say that tests must play through the real input as well as with bots, since those two caught more than I expected.',\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  testing: 'Headless Node playthroughs with bots, one test command;\"\"\",\"\"\"  testing: 'Headless Node playthroughs with bots, plus scripts playing through real keys, stick and mouse, one test command;\"\"\"),\n])\np='../PROGRESS.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns+=\"\"\"\nSecond audit results so far: play.mjs (keys, pad, mouse through the real input layer) found Pier Jump could not be jumped with a mouse. details.mjs found click-to-walk hitting invisible walls, hoops dropping during the count, Step matching stale notes. Strict 12 px margin applied everywhere (layout test now enforces it). Firefox with prefs forced: navigator.gpu present, adapter null; WebKit: no navigator.gpu: neither can run the game here, failure screens looked at, AIHub.fail voids the round. Real Holding Still run captured as 12 frames and looked at; head/Dot correlation test added. CREDITS.md compared character for character and scrolled to its last line.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^import.*layout\" tests/headless/systems.mjs | cut -c1-80; echo patched","description":"Hold the Podium menu until Ounce finishes and update the feedback answers","timeout":20000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3935,"cache_read_input_tokens":936129,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3935},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard",