aceholders | grep clean, including tests |\n| Feedback in chat + About | test 20: all 8 pages, no unknown; looked at |\n| Exit interview | written + parsed by tools/build.mjs; shape test |\n| Holding Still feel (19.3) | real run captured as 12 frames and looked at; head/Dot correlation test. Bot table through the real scene: pad 78/58/39/21, keyboard 78/58/40/24, mouse 78/59/39/24 (plan: stick 71/51/31/18, keyboard 88/70/47/28, mouse 95/82/59/36). The scripted person reacts the same on every device, so this shows fairness, not a match to the plan's keyboard and mouse rows. No person has played it |\n| Kit hand-back | node check.mjs on built html: OK WebGPU exit 0 |\n| Final run | node tools/test.mjs: 411/411, exit 0, on the shipped html. Afterwards only test files changed (unused lines removed): details and play re-run, 103/103 |\n\n## Second audit (stop hook again): work list\nBots bypass input, so: device-level play of every activity with keys, pad, mouse (tests/headless/play.mjs); real-time Step audio clock in a browser; real captured Holding Still run with body-vs-Dot correlation; keyboard and mouse rows of the bot table; CREDITS.md scrolled to its end with exact text; WebKit/Firefox failure screens and AIHub.fail; hub mouse and pad tests; hammock branches; classmate reaction; Long Stand schedule; rep gag; step windows; no Math.random. Plan misses: 12 px safe margin (strict layout test), 2 px lines, teal speaker names, dusk lanterns, HEADER/PIER into src/data, no pause after session end, Research field wording.\n\nSecond audit results so far: play.mjs (keys, pad, mouse through the real input layer) found Pier Jump could not be jumped with a mouse. details.mjs found click-to-walk hitting invisible walls, hoops dropping during the count, Step matching stale notes. Strict 12 px margin applied everywhere (layout test now enforces it). Firefox with prefs forced: navigator.gpu present, adapter null; WebKit: no navigator.gpu: neither can run the game here, failure screens looked at, AIHub.fail voids the round. Real Holding Still run captured as 12 frames and looked at; head/Dot correlation test added. CREDITS.md compared character for character and scrolled to its last line.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":25,"oldLines":7,"newStart":25,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - Stuck/guess wrong: awaiting App.go while engine in manual step mode hangs (no frames run); e.step() makes it manual"," "," ## Next up","-- Nothing left but the final chat reply.","+- Nothing left but cleaning the dev folder, checking the hand-in files and the final chat reply."," - More bot-found tuning notes in run log below."," - Run log: 1080p look caught Step avatars vanishing: ease name 'outQuad' (tween name) in a ClipDef bakes NaN and validateClip/analyzeClip stay silent (engine feedback!). Also giant ripple cone on splash, huge near-camera rain. Tests caught Lane constructor dropping seat so ghost messages never reached ghosts (harness cannot see it), Medley idling 10 s after the last event; test runner race lost results (fixed); playthrough caught Esc in Jar/Hall opening pause instead of Back; bot sweep caught Step palette crash, Tray bodies sleeping through gravity (all scores 0), reps unreachable 3 stars, hoop/header too generous, jog steering reversed."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SGo8SjqJw9XRAowHdpVcwx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
