{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J519QoEgc4Nc5dHKW6QzxT","type":"tool_result","content":"524\t\n525\t**Sliders (live, each read by the code every step; registry in `src/core/tunables.js`):**\n526\t\n527\t| Tab | Variables, with defaults |\n528\t|---|---|\n529\t| Balance | dotInstability .6, dotAuthority 3, dotDamping 3.4, dotNoise .8, dotLag .08, ringScale 1, gustForce 1.6, mouseLeanRadius 70 |\n530\t| Breath and reps | breathBonus .55, repLag .10, repFatigue .10, repTempoScale 1 |\n531\t| Rhythm | stepWindow 1, stepOffsetMs 0, hoopLow .9, hoopHigh 2.4, hoopLiftRate .35 |\n532\t| Games | headerInterval 1.0, slackWalkInst 2.6, trayGravity 9.8, trayMaxTilt 14, jogTargetCadence 3, pierBoost 2.14 |\n533\t| Economy | dripRate 1, starThresholdScale 1, ageTrainingWeight .5 |\n534\t\n535\tEach slider shows its value and default. **One button resets the tab, one resets everything.** Export prints the changed values as JSON to the console and copies them if allowed, so a designer can paste them into `src/data/`.\n536\t\n537\t**Tools tab:** go to day 1-7; jump to any activity or scene; finish the current activity with 0-3★; give 50 Drips; unlock all; autopilot (bot skill picker); god mode (Dot can't leave the ring); time scale .25-3; overlay (scene, state, Dot, ring, fps, last device); hide HUD; free camera (`engine.setCamera({ preset: 'free' }, { syncUrl: false })`); dialogue tester (any line, with voice); sound test (every song, SFX, speaker); animation viewer (every clip on an avatar); reset save.\n538\t\n539\t---\n540\t\n541\t## 11. Attract mode"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"dbba2ddb-8575-4c97-9fcf-b132deeae550","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:31:29.002Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","content":"\n**Sliders (live, each read by the code every step; registry in `src/core/tunables.js`):**\n\n| Tab | Variables, with defaults |\n|---|---|\n| Balance | dotInstability .6, dotAuthority 3, dotDamping 3.4, dotNoise .8, dotLag .08, ringScale 1, gustForce 1.6, mouseLeanRadius 70 |\n| Breath and reps | breathBonus .55, repLag .10, repFatigue .10, repTempoScale 1 |\n| Rhythm | stepWindow 1, stepOffsetMs 0, hoopLow .9, hoopHigh 2.4, hoopLiftRate .35 |\n| Games | headerInterval 1.0, slackWalkInst 2.6, trayGravity 9.8, trayMaxTilt 14, jogTargetCadence 3, pierBoost 2.14 |\n| Economy | dripRate 1, starThresholdScale 1, ageTrainingWeight .5 |\n\nEach slider shows its value and default. **One button resets the tab, one resets everything.** Export prints the changed values as JSON to the console and copies them if allowed, so a designer can paste them into `src/data/`.\n\n**Tools tab:** go to day 1-7; jump to any activity or scene; finish the current activity with 0-3★; give 50 Drips; unlock all; autopilot (bot skill picker); god mode (Dot can't leave the ring); time scale .25-3; overlay (scene, state, Dot, ring, fps, last device); hide HUD; free camera (`engine.setCamera({ preset: 'free' }, { syncUrl: false })`); dialogue tester (any line, with voice); sound test (every song, SFX, speaker); animation viewer (every clip on an avatar); reset save.\n\n---\n\n## 11. Attract mode","numLines":18,"startLine":524,"totalLines":993}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01J519QoEgc4Nc5dHKW6QzxT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
