ore).padStart(3)}  correct ${r.correct} wrong ${r.wrong} dropped ${r.dropped} t ${r.t}`);\n}\nprocess.exit(0);\nEOF\ntimeout 280 node .scratch/tray-sweep.mjs </dev/null 2>&1 | cut -c1-150 | tail -18","description":"Fix test references and measure Tray scores with all eight vitamins live","timeout":290000}}}
