{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HZDtgZyCMBu3oHcKFBHDeb","type":"tool_result","content":"198\t**Staging rules ✔ (found in test renders):**\n199\t- Put Coach to one side of the player, not directly behind; their silhouettes merged.\n200\t- Never draw the dial over an avatar. In 3-mat staging the sky above the player's head is empty: centre the dial at (W/2, 56), radius 44.\n201\t- Make all HUD lines at least 2 art px thick. A 1 px ring vanishes at 10 feet.\n202\t\n203\t**Lean body language:** after `mixer.update(dt)`, add the Dot to the pose: `torso.rotateZ(-dot.x * 0.18); torso.rotateX(-dot.y * 0.12); pelvis.position.x += dot.x * 0.05`. Outside the ring, add a tremble. Far outside, blend to the kit's `Teeter` clip. The player should be able to read the Dot from the body alone.\n204\t\n205\t### 5.1 Holding Still (Pavilion, yoga)\n206\t\n207\tCoach demonstrates on a dais. You hold the pose by keeping the Dot in the ring: settle 4 s (unscored), hold, release 2 s.\n208\t\n209\t| Pose | Clip | Ring | Twist | Hold | Breath |\n210\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n211\t| Apologetic Tree | Tree | .40 | none | 25 s | none |\n212\t| Startled Heron | Heron | .36 | slow bias wander, ±.12 on x | 25 s | none |\n213\t| Reluctant Warrior | Warrior | .32 | y noise ×1.3 | 30 s | 8 s |\n214\t| The Chair Nobody Asked For | Chair | .30 | noise ramps 1→1.5 | 30 s | 8 s |\n215\t| Tax Season | Fold | .28 | bias wander ±.18 | 30 s | 6 s |\n216\t| Plank Negotiation | Plank | .24 | inst ×1.2, tremor after 20 s | 35 s | 6 s |\n217\t\n218\t- **Breath:** a bar rises and falls (\"In…\" / \"Out…\"). Hold R2 / Space / left mouse on In, release on Out. Keep a sync value `s` (0..1, smoothed), and `m.noise *= 1.25 - 0.55 * s`, so breathing well literally calms you.\n219\t- **Score:** `100 × inRing`, or `100 × (0.8 × inRing + 0.2 × breath)` when breath is on. Stars 45/70/90.\n220\t- **Juice:** chime when the Dot enters the ring, ring brightens with time inside, slow camera push-in while steady, classmates wobbling, Kevin on the rail, sunbeams, dust motes.\n221\t\n222\t### 5.2 The Rep Shed (strength)\n223\t\n224\t**You scrub the animation with the stick** ✔ (`action.paused = true; action.time = r * duration; mixer.update(0)`). A marker on a big vertical (or horizontal) track follows the tempo curve; you match it.\n225\t\n226\t| Exercise | Clip | Input | Reps | Tempo |\n227\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n228\t| Squats of Regret | SquatRep | stick down = deeper | 10 | 3.2 s |\n229\t| Apology Lunges | LungeRep, mirrored for left | stick left/right, targets alternate | 10 | 3.2 s |\n230\t| Overhead Mortgage | Press (new) | stick up = press; `repLag` ×1.5 (heavy) | 8 | 3.6 s |\n231\t\n232\t- **Target per rep:** 0→1 in 40% of the tempo, hold 15%, 1→0 in 35%, rest 10%. `r` follows the input with lag `repLag` 0.10 s.\n233\t- **Keyboard uses rate control:** S/W move `r` at the target speed, no key holds it. Otherwise keys could only slam between ends.\n234\t- **Rep quality:** `1 - 1.6 × mean|r - target|`, shown as Perfect ≥ .85, Good ≥ .65, else Wobbly. Score = mean × 100. Stars 55/75/90.\n235\t- **Fatigue:** tremor on `r`, amplitude `repFatigue × (rep/total)²`, default .10.\n236\t- **The gag:** Coach says \"Last one.\" Then \"Last one.\" Then \"I lied. This is the last one.\" Every exercise runs 2 reps past its announced end.\n237\t- **Set dressing:** a gym wall with the engine's `Mirror` showing your reps (attach in `setup`, stop in `dispose`); giant dumbbells.\n238\t\n239\t### 5.3 Hoop Economics (Beat Beach, aerobics)\n240\t\n241\t**Circle the stick** (or the mouse, or roll W-D-S-A) to keep hoops up.\n242\t\n243\t- Angular speed: from unwrapped `atan2(u)` when `|u| > .5`, smoothed .25 s. Band: `hoopLow` 0.9 to `hoopHigh` 2.4 rev/s, in the current direction.\n244\t- Lift `L`: +.35/s in band, -.25/s out of band, -.5/s wrong way. At 0 the hoop drops, and you pick it up for 1.5 s, with comment.\n245\t- 60 s: anticlockwise 25 s; \"Now the other way.\" clockwise 25 s; either way 10 s.\n246\t- **Thrown hoops:** every ~9 s June winds up on one side, with 1.5 s of telegraph and a landing shadow. Flick `|u.x| > .7` toward that side in the last .4 s to catch it. Up to 4 hoops, each adding +0.5 to the rotation multiplier. Flicking interrupts your circling, which is the trade-off.\n247\t- Score = weighted rotations in band. Stars 35/70/110.\n248\t- **Look:** torus meshes orbiting the hips, tilt by `L`, pelvis circling, sparkles in band.\n249\t\n250\t### 5.4 Step Class (Beat Beach, rhythm)\n251\t\n252\tFootprints scroll to a hit line. Left foot: L1 or L2 / F or ← / left mouse button. Right foot: R1 or R2 / J or → / right mouse button.\n253\t\n254\t- 104 BPM, 32 bars (about 74 s): intro 4, verse 8, chorus 8, breakdown 4, final 8. Charts are strings in data: `L.R.L.R.`.\n255\t- Windows: Perfect ±55 ms, Good ±100, OK ±140 (scale `stepWindow`). Accuracy = (P + .7G + .4O) / N. Stars 55/75/90.\n256\t- **Beat clock:** the song's step clock when audio runs (`ctx.audio.song.start` and `ctx.audio.song.parsed.stepTime`, in the audio context's time; undocumented but present in 0.46.0), otherwise game time (headless, replays). A **Step timing offset** setting covers latency.\n257\t- On pause: stop the music; on resume, count in and restart at the current bar.\n258\t- Avatars step on platforms using the kit's `StepUp` / `StepDown` or your own. Classmates dance with occasional mistakes. Confetti at combo milestones."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"1d8df97b-16f8-46ec-a36d-488502c7b157","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:09:16.590Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","content":"**Staging rules ✔ (found in test renders):**\n- Put Coach to one side of the player, not directly behind; their silhouettes merged.\n- Never draw the dial over an avatar. In 3-mat staging the sky above the player's head is empty: centre the dial at (W/2, 56), radius 44.\n- Make all HUD lines at least 2 art px thick. A 1 px ring vanishes at 10 feet.\n\n**Lean body language:** after `mixer.update(dt)`, add the Dot to the pose: `torso.rotateZ(-dot.x * 0.18); torso.rotateX(-dot.y * 0.12); pelvis.position.x += dot.x * 0.05`. Outside the ring, add a tremble. Far outside, blend to the kit's `Teeter` clip. The player should be able to read the Dot from the body alone.\n\n### 5.1 Holding Still (Pavilion, yoga)\n\nCoach demonstrates on a dais. You hold the pose by keeping the Dot in the ring: settle 4 s (unscored), hold, release 2 s.\n\n| Pose | Clip | Ring | Twist | Hold | Breath |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Apologetic Tree | Tree | .40 | none | 25 s | none |\n| Startled Heron | Heron | .36 | slow bias wander, ±.12 on x | 25 s | none |\n| Reluctant Warrior | Warrior | .32 | y noise ×1.3 | 30 s | 8 s |\n| The Chair Nobody Asked For | Chair | .30 | noise ramps 1→1.5 | 30 s | 8 s |\n| Tax Season | Fold | .28 | bias wander ±.18 | 30 s | 6 s |\n| Plank Negotiation | Plank | .24 | inst ×1.2, tremor after 20 s | 35 s | 6 s |\n\n- **Breath:** a bar rises and falls (\"In…\" / \"Out…\"). Hold R2 / Space / left mouse on In, release on Out. Keep a sync value `s` (0..1, smoothed), and `m.noise *= 1.25 - 0.55 * s`, so breathing well literally calms you.\n- **Score:** `100 × inRing`, or `100 × (0.8 × inRing + 0.2 × breath)` when breath is on. Stars 45/70/90.\n- **Juice:** chime when the Dot enters the ring, ring brightens with time inside, slow camera push-in while steady, classmates wobbling, Kevin on the rail, sunbeams, dust motes.\n\n### 5.2 The Rep Shed (strength)\n\n**You scrub the animation with the stick** ✔ (`action.paused = true; action.time = r * duration; mixer.update(0)`). A marker on a big vertical (or horizontal) track follows the tempo curve; you match it.\n\n| Exercise | Clip | Input | Reps | Tempo |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Squats of Regret | SquatRep | stick down = deeper | 10 | 3.2 s |\n| Apology Lunges | LungeRep, mirrored for left | stick left/right, targets alternate | 10 | 3.2 s |\n| Overhead Mortgage | Press (new) | stick up = press; `repLag` ×1.5 (heavy) | 8 | 3.6 s |\n\n- **Target per rep:** 0→1 in 40% of the tempo, hold 15%, 1→0 in 35%, rest 10%. `r` follows the input with lag `repLag` 0.10 s.\n- **Keyboard uses rate control:** S/W move `r` at the target speed, no key holds it. Otherwise keys could only slam between ends.\n- **Rep quality:** `1 - 1.6 × mean|r - target|`, shown as Perfect ≥ .85, Good ≥ .65, else Wobbly. Score = mean × 100. Stars 55/75/90.\n- **Fatigue:** tremor on `r`, amplitude `repFatigue × (rep/total)²`, default .10.\n- **The gag:** Coach says \"Last one.\" Then \"Last one.\" Then \"I lied. This is the last one.\" Every exercise runs 2 reps past its announced end.\n- **Set dressing:** a gym wall with the engine's `Mirror` showing your reps (attach in `setup`, stop in `dispose`); giant dumbbells.\n\n### 5.3 Hoop Economics (Beat Beach, aerobics)\n\n**Circle the stick** (or the mouse, or roll W-D-S-A) to keep hoops up.\n\n- Angular speed: from unwrapped `atan2(u)` when `|u| > .5`, smoothed .25 s. Band: `hoopLow` 0.9 to `hoopHigh` 2.4 rev/s, in the current direction.\n- Lift `L`: +.35/s in band, -.25/s out of band, -.5/s wrong way. At 0 the hoop drops, and you pick it up for 1.5 s, with comment.\n- 60 s: anticlockwise 25 s; \"Now the other way.\" clockwise 25 s; either way 10 s.\n- **Thrown hoops:** every ~9 s June winds up on one side, with 1.5 s of telegraph and a landing shadow. Flick `|u.x| > .7` toward that side in the last .4 s to catch it. Up to 4 hoops, each adding +0.5 to the rotation multiplier. Flicking interrupts your circling, which is the trade-off.\n- Score = weighted rotations in band. Stars 35/70/110.\n- **Look:** torus meshes orbiting the hips, tilt by `L`, pelvis circling, sparkles in band.\n\n### 5.4 Step Class (Beat Beach, rhythm)\n\nFootprints scroll to a hit line. Left foot: L1 or L2 / F or ← / left mouse button. Right foot: R1 or R2 / J or → / right mouse button.\n\n- 104 BPM, 32 bars (about 74 s): intro 4, verse 8, chorus 8, breakdown 4, final 8. Charts are strings in data: `L.R.L.R.`.\n- Windows: Perfect ±55 ms, Good ±100, OK ±140 (scale `stepWindow`). Accuracy = (P + .7G + .4O) / N. Stars 55/75/90.\n- **Beat clock:** the song's step clock when audio runs (`ctx.audio.song.start` and `ctx.audio.song.parsed.stepTime`, in the audio context's time; undocumented but present in 0.46.0), otherwise game time (headless, replays). A **Step timing offset** setting covers latency.\n- On pause: stop the music; on resume, count in and restart at the current bar.\n- Avatars step on platforms using the kit's `StepUp` / `StepDown` or your own. Classmates dance with occasional mistakes. Confetti at combo milestones.","numLines":61,"startLine":198,"totalLines":993}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HZDtgZyCMBu3oHcKFBHDeb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjbZyLfczn13xhJ3zSj9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014eXhckMUvPz9uWGs3Q9NWo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work\nsed -n 322,345p PLAN.md | cut -c1-300\ncd WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\necho \"=== pier camera / others\"; sed -n 16,30p src/scenes/activity/base.js | cut -c1-170\necho \"=== jog clip\"; grep -n \"name: 'Jog'\" src/art/clips.js | cut -c1-200\necho \"=== slack visuals\"; grep -n -E \"wind|flag|sag|Sag|Line|segment\" src/scenes/activity/slackline.js | cut -c1-150 | head -14\necho \"=== coach wait lines\"; grep -rn -iE \"unimpressed|scooter|she waits|waiting\" src/data/lines.js src/scenes/activity/jog.js | cut -c1-180 | head\necho \"=== poses data\"; sed -n 1,16p src/data/poses.js | cut -c1-200\necho \"=== reps data\"; sed -n 1,14p src/data/reps.js | cut -c1-200\necho \"=== hoop data\"; cut -c1-220 src/data/hoop.js | head -14\necho \"=== step\"; grep -n -E \"PERFECT|GOOD|OK|window|0\\.055|0\\.1\\b|0\\.14|BPM|accuracy|combo\" src/scenes/activity/step.js | cut -c1-170 | head -16; grep -n -E \"STEP_BPM\\s*=\" src/audio/songs.js | cut -c1-120\necho \"=== longstand\"; cut -c1-200 src/data/longstand.js | head -22","description":"Read the remaining activity details and the code that implements them"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17699,"cache_read_input_tokens":308537,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17699},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"55de4d9a-1521-4ab6-90fe-75b0563d3f64","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:09:21.052Z","request_id":"req_011CgjbZy2pAaj3mG6CZxPF5","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014eXhckMUvPz9uWGs3Q9NWo":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work\nsed -n 322,345p PLAN.md | cut -c1-300\ncd WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\necho \"=== pier camera / others\"; sed -n 16,30p src/scenes/activity/base.js | cut -c1-170\necho \"=== jog clip\"; grep -n \"name: 'Jog'\" src/art/clips.js | cut -c1-200\necho \"=== slack visuals\"; grep -n -E \"wind|flag|sag|Sag|Line|segment\" src/scenes/activity/slackline.js | cut -c1-150 | head -14\necho \"=== coach wait lines\"; grep -rn -iE \"unimpressed|scooter|she waits|waiting\" src/data/lines.js src/scenes/activity/jog.js | cut -c1-180 | head\necho \"=== poses data\"; sed -n 1,16p src/data/poses.js | cut -c1-200\necho \"=== reps data\"; sed -n 1,14p src/data/reps.js | cut -c1-200\necho \"=== hoop data\"; cut -c1-220 src/data/hoop.js | head -14\necho \"=== step\"; grep -n -E \"PERFECT|GOOD|OK|window|0\\.055|0\\.1\\b|0\\.14|BPM|accuracy|combo\" src/scenes/activity/step.js | cut -c1-170 | head -16; grep -n -E \"STEP_BPM\\s*=\" src/audio/songs.js | cut -c1-120\necho \"=== longstand\"; cut -c1-200 src/data/longstand.js | head -22","description":"Read the remaining activity details and the code that implements them"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014eXhckMUvPz9uWGs3Q9NWo","type":"tool_result","content":"| 50 | | ring .28 |\n| 55 | June: \"Are you nearly done?\" | text drifts across the dial |\n| 65 | Kettlebell Volcano rumbles | shake, random impulse |\n| 75 | Rain stops, sun out, music swells | ring .24 |\n| 85 | Kevin leaves | bias off, impulse |\n| 90 | Coach: \"You may blink.\" | end |\n\nThen the confession and ending, played with a `Timeline` (section 13). At 0★: \"You stood. Sort of.\"\n\n---\n\n## 6. Weigh-In and Wobble Age\n\nYour avatar steps onto Ounce (\"Ow.\" every time; the delivery varies). Close-up, huge dial, tiny animated needle.\n\n| Test | Rules (12-15 s) | Result T (0..1) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Stillness | Ring .30. Dot and ring fade after 3 s: \"Eyes closed.\" | in-ring fraction |\n| Lean | Three targets (\"70% left\"). Reach and hold ±.1 for 1.5 s each. | based on time |\n| Chase | Follow a slow target on a Lissajous path | 1 - mean distance × 2 |\n\nThen one question (section 8), then the reveal: the needle spins, the number rolls, Ounce remarks.\n\n```\n=== pier camera / others\n\nexport const CAMERAS = {\n  lane3: () => laneCamera(3),\n  lane4: () => laneCamera(4),\n  header: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 3.1, 8.6], target: [0, 1.4, 0], fov: 34 }),\n  slackline: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 3.2, -6], target: [0, 1.6, 6], fov: 46 }),\n  tray: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 9.2, 2.3], target: [0, 0, 0.1], fov: 30 }),\n  pier: () => ({ preset: 'side', zoom: 1, minZoom: 0.2, maxZoom: 4 }),\n  jog: () => ({ preset: 'iso', zoom: 1.4, minZoom: 1.4, maxZoom: 1.4 }),\n  stand: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 2.8, 9], target: [0, 1.75, 0], fov: 32 }),\n};\n\nexport class ActivityScene extends BaseScene {\n  canPause = true;\n  id = 'activity';\n=== jog clip\n84:  gaitClip(HERO_RIG, { name: 'Jog', frames: 16, speed: 3, stance: 0.42, hip: -0.04, bob: 0.03, lift: 0.1, lean: 6, sway: 2, arms: { swing: 30, elbow: 75 } }),\n=== slack visuals\n35:    // The line: segments we move each frame so it sags under your feet.\n45:    this.flags = [];\n53:      this.flags.push({ z, f, pole });\n105:    // Gusts: every 6 m, telegraphed 1.5 s by flags and wind lines.\n193:      a.position.y = SLACK.height - this.sagAt(this.z);\n201:    // The line sags under your feet.\n205:      const y = SLACK.height - this.sagAtLine(z);\n210:    for (const fl of this.flags) { fl.f.rotation.y = blowing * 0.9 + Math.sin(this.t * 4 + fl.z) * 0.1; fl.f.position.x = 3.05 + blowing * 0.3; }\n222:  sagAt(z) { return this.sagAtLine(z); }\n223:  sagAtLine(z) {\n=== coach wait lines\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:1:// Island Jog: a rail run round the whole island. Coach paces you on a white mobility scooter.\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:43:    this.scooter = place(ctx, 'mobility-scooter', { actor: true }).object;\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:213:    // Coach goes at exactly target speed. More than 12 m behind, she waits, unimpressed.\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:267:    // Coach and her scooter.\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:272:    this.scooter.position.set(cp.x, 0.06, cp.z);\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:273:    this.scooter.rotation.y = yaw;\nsrc/scenes/activity/jog.js:310:    if (gap >= JOG.wait - 0.2) { hud.rect(cx - 80, y + 22, 160, 12, 'navy'); say(hud, cx - 76, y + 24, 'Coach waits, unimpressed.', { color: 'sand', \nsrc/data/lines.js:33:    first: ['That chair has been waiting a long time. Sorry about it.'],\nsrc/data/lines.js:118:    1: ['You kept her in sight, at points. It\\'s a small island.', 'You were overtaken by a scooter. At a walking pace.'],\nsrc/data/lines.js:120:    3: ['You kept up. She has never been kept up with.', 'A perfect lap. The scooter is thinking about its choices.'],\n=== poses data\n// Holding Still. A new pose needs a row here and nothing else.\nexport const POSES = {\n  tree: { clip: 'Tree', ring: 0.40, hold: 25, breath: 0, twist: {} },\n  heron: { clip: 'Heron', ring: 0.36, hold: 25, breath: 0, twist: { wanderX: 0.12, wanderSpeed: 0.28 } },\n  warrior: { clip: 'Warrior', ring: 0.32, hold: 30, breath: 8, twist: { noiseY: 1.3 } },\n  chair: { clip: 'Chair', ring: 0.30, hold: 30, breath: 8, twist: { noiseRamp: [1, 1.5] } },\n  fold: { clip: 'Fold', ring: 0.28, hold: 30, breath: 6, twist: { wanderX: 0.18, wanderSpeed: 0.33 } },\n  plank: { clip: 'Plank', ring: 0.24, hold: 35, breath: 6, twist: { inst: 1.2, tremorAfter: 20 } },\n};\nexport const SETTLE = 4;\nexport const RELEASE = 2;\nexport const HOLD_LINES = ['Hold. You may blink on Thursday.', 'Stillness is a muscle. So is regret. We train both here.', 'Do not look at me. I am not doing anything.'];\n=== reps data\n// The Rep Shed. Input: which way the stick goes to do the rep.\nexport const REPS = {\n  squats: { clip: 'SquatRep', input: 'down', reps: 10, tempo: 3.2 },\n  lunges: { clip: 'LungeRep', clipLeft: 'LungeRepL', input: 'sides', reps: 10, tempo: 3.2 },\n  press: { clip: 'Press', input: 'up', reps: 8, tempo: 3.6, lagScale: 1.5 },\n};\nexport const EXTRA_REPS = 2; // Every exercise runs 2 reps past its announced end.\n/** Share of a rep's tempo: up, hold, down, rest. */\nexport const REP_SHAPE = { up: 0.4, hold: 0.15, down: 0.35, rest: 0.1 };\n=== hoop data\n// June's throws: every ~9 s, 1.5 s of telegraph, flick in the last .4 s.\nexport const HOOP_THROW = { first: 7, gap: 9, telegraph: 1.5, window: 0.4 };\n=== step\n4:import { STEP_BPM, STEP_SONG, stepSongFrom } from '../../audio/songs.js';\n12:export const BAR_SECONDS = (60 / STEP_BPM) * 4;\n35:    this.windowScale = this.hard.window ?? 1;\n42:    l.state = { i: 0, P: 0, G: 0, O: 0, M: 0, combo: 0, best: 0, last: null, lastT: 0, botI: 0, botAt: null, botFoot: null, stepClip: null };\n48:  window(name) { return WINDOWS[name] * T.stepWindow * this.windowScale; }\n54:    const ok = this.window('ok');\n63:    lane.avatar?.play(foot === 'L' ? 'StepL' : 'StepR', { once: true, fade: 0.04, then: () => lane.avatar?.play('StepRest', { fade: 0.1 }) });\n64:    if (found < 0) { st.combo = 0; st.last = 'Off'; st.lastT = now; return; }\n66:    const grade = bestErr <= this.window('perfect') ? 'P' : bestErr <= this.window('good') ? 'G' : 'O';\n68:    st.combo++;\n69:    st.best = Math.max(st.best, st.combo);\n70:    st.last = grade === 'P' ? 'Perfect' : grade === 'G' ? 'Good' : 'OK';\n74:      if (st.combo % 16 === 0) { App.sfx('combo'); this.ctx.particles.burst('confetti', [lane.x, 1.6, lane.z]); }\n84:    const ok = this.window('ok');\n89:        st.combo = 0;\n176:      if (st.combo >= 4) sayRight(hud, x + w - 2, y + h + 3, `${st.combo} combo`, { color: 'white', name: 'combo' });\n92:export const STEP_BPM = 104;\n=== longstand\n// The Long Stand, as a timeline. A new event is a new row.\nexport const STAND_LENGTH = 90;\nexport const STAND_TIMELINE = [\n  { t: 0, say: ['coach', 'Stand.'], ring: 0.4 },\n  { t: 10, kevinOn: true, biasX: 0.1, say: ['ounce', 'Kevin is on your head. He is staff. Carry on.'] },\n  { t: 20, sneeze: true, impulse: [0, -0.6], say: ['dennis', 'Sorry. Sorry. It\\'s just the one nose.'] },\n  { t: 30, ring: 0.34 },\n  { t: 35, rain: true, noise: 1.2 },\n  { t: 45, clap: true, say: ['ounce', 'Ignore her.'] },\n  { t: 50, ring: 0.28 },\n  { t: 55, juneText: 'Are you nearly done?', say: ['june', 'Are you nearly done?'] },\n  { t: 65, rumble: true, randomImpulse: 0.6 },\n  { t: 75, rain: false, noise: 1, sun: true, ring: 0.24, swell: true },\n  { t: 85, kevinOn: false, biasX: 0, impulse: [0.3, 0.2], say: ['ounce', 'Kevin has left. He said nothing. He never does.'] },\n  { t: 90, say: ['coach', 'You may blink.'] },\n];","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"99f27b98-aaa4-401f-aec0-974289c39d03","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:09:21.241Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"| 50 | | ring .28 |\n| 55 | June: \"Are you nearly done?\" | text drifts across the dial |\n| 65 | Kettlebell Volcano rumbles | shake, random impulse |\n| 75 | Rain stops, sun out, music swells | ring .24 |\n| 85 | Kevin leaves | bias off, impulse |\n| 90 | Coach: \"You may blink.\" | end |\n\nThen the confession and ending, played with a `Timeline` (section 13). At 0★: \"You stood. Sort of.\"\n\n---\n\n## 6. Weigh-In and Wobble Age\n\nYour avatar steps onto Ounce (\"Ow.\" every time; the delivery varies). Close-up, huge dial, tiny animated needle.\n\n| Test | Rules (12-15 s) | Result T (0..1) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Stillness | Ring .30. Dot and ring fade after 3 s: \"Eyes closed.\" | in-ring fraction |\n| Lean | Three targets (\"70% left\"). Reach and hold ±.1 for 1.5 s each. | based on time |\n| Chase | Follow a slow target on a Lissajous path | 1 - mean distance × 2 |\n\nThen one question (section 8), then the reveal: the needle spins, the number rolls, Ounce remarks.\n\n```\n=== pier camera / others\n\nexport const CAMERAS = {\n  lane3: () => laneCamera(3),\n  lane4: () => laneCamera(4),\n  header: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 3.1, 8.6], target: [0, 1.4, 0], fov: 34 }),\n  slackline: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 3.2, -6], target: [0, 1.6, 6], fov: 46 }),\n  tray: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 9.2, 2.3], target: [0, 0, 0.1], fov: 30 }),\n  pier: () => ({ preset: 'side', zoom: 1, minZoom: 0.2, maxZoom: 4 }),\n  jog: () => ({ preset: 'iso', zoom: 1.4, minZoom: 1.4, maxZoom: 1.4 }),\n  stand: () => ({ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 2.8, 9], target: [0, 1.75, 0], fov: 32 }),\n};\n\nexport class ActivityScene extends BaseScene {\n  canPause = true;\n  id = 'activity';\n=== jog clip\n84:  gaitClip(HERO_RIG, { name: 'Jog', frames: 16, speed: 3, stance: 0.42, hip: -0.04, bob: 0.03, lift: 0.1, lean: 6, sway: 2, arms: { swing: 30, elbow: 75 } }),\n=== slack visuals\n35:    // The line: segments we move each frame so it sags under your feet.\n45:    this.flags = [];\n53:      this.flags.push({ z, f, pole });\n105:    // Gusts: every 6 m, telegraphed 1.5 s by flags and wind lines.\n193:   