{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgjd5WbYDXcFKEQUUF8cW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J4vqSFRDzbphVP6cpqJ9Vg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\nHTML=../WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741.html\necho \"== newer than html:\"; find src tools -type f -newer \"$HTML\" | head\ntimeout 200 node check.mjs \"$HTML\" </dev/null > .scratch/check.log 2>&1; echo \"check.mjs exit $?\"\ntimeout 200 node check.mjs --sheets src/art/models.js </dev/null > .scratch/sheets.log 2>&1; echo \"sheets exit $?\"; grep -c \"0 problem(s), 0 warning(s)\" .scratch/sheets.log; grep -E \"model \" .scratch/sheets.log | grep -v \"0 problem(s), 0 warning(s)\" | cut -c1-120 | head\ncd ..\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='PROGRESS.md'; t=open(p).read()\na='Known remaining difference: Jog path is 210 m (70 s at target pace); plan says \"about 220 m ... about 75 s\". Left as it is: the path follows the island\\'s edge.\\n'\nassert a in t\nt=t.replace(a,'')\na=\"| Final run | node tools/test.mjs: 434/434, exit 0, on the shipped html |\"\nassert a in t\nt=t.replace(a,\"| Final run | node tools/test.mjs: 455/455, exit 0, on the shipped html |\")\nt+=\"\"\"\n## Fourth audit (stop hook again): the plan read line by line against the code\nEarlier audits missed things, so each activity's numbers were read against the code, then pinned in tests/headless/figures.mjs. Found and fixed:\n\n| Plan says | Was | Now |\n|---|---|---|\n| Jog path about 220 m, about 75 s | 210 m, 70 s | 218.5 m, 72.8 s at target pace; a good bot takes 78.5 s |\n| Jog score 70 x pace% + 30 x cups% | also x .8 if unfinished | as written |\n| Slackline walk 1.1 m/s past u.y .3 | scaled with the push | flat 1.1 m/s |\n| Header daze with circling stars | no stars | 3 stars round the head for the .6 s |\n| Heron and Tax Season: bias wander | the ring drifted | a push of +-.12 and +-.18 on the Dot, ring still |\n| Pier: press as you reach the lip | an early press jumped from halfway down the pier | only inside the lip window |\n| Kettlebell Volcano (-15,-14), Foam Roller Hills (15,-14) | 6 m and 4 m away, no colliders | at those coordinates (hills at (15,-14.6), clear of the stage), solid |\n| Dev Tools: one Tools tab; \"Breath and reps\" | Go and Test tabs; \"Breath\" | as written, paged |\n| Evening Report about 20 s | 14 s at reading pace | 19 s; Weigh-In 38-45 s (plan about 45) |\n\nConfirmed unchanged and now tested: Header 4.5 m/s, 1.4 s flight, 1.3 to .7 s gaps, 71/24/4 share measured against 70/25/5, tiers, stars; Slackline figures; Pier formula, 6 to 14 m/s, inst 3, ring .45, cannonball .5 s, hitstop .1, .25 time; Jog band, stumble, stitch. Songs and voices read against the plan's tables: all match.\nPier bots, best of three: sloppy 15.9 (0 stars), average 21.5 (1), good 36.9 (2), expert 40.7 (3). Plan's stars 18/28/38.\nHolding Still feel: section 19 step 3 asks for the bot table and a run captured as frames. Both done, and frames retaken after the Heron change. A person's judgement is the one thing this computer can't supply.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\nEOF\ncd WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\nMINE=\"claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3\"\necho \"== my processes\"; for p in /proc/[0-9]*; do pid=${p#/proc/}; [ \"$pid\" = \"$$\" ] && continue; [ \"$pid\" = \"$PPID\" ] && continue; c=$(readlink $p/cwd 2>/dev/null); case \"$c\" in *\"$MINE\"*) echo \"$pid $(tr '\\0' ' ' < $p/cmdline | cut -c1-90 | head -1)\";; esac; done; echo \"(end)\"\nrm -rf .scratch .shots .build .harness node_modules package-lock.json check\nls -A | tr '\\n' ' '; echo\nsha256sum -c vendor/pixel-engine.sha256\ngrep -rnE \"\\bvoid [a-zA-Z_]|TODO|FIXME\" src tools tests --include=*.mjs --include=*.js | grep -v credits-text | cut -c1-120; echo \"(placeholder scan done)\"\ncd ..; ls -A | tr '\\n' ' '; echo\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('exit-interview.json'))\nprint('keys', list(d.keys()))\nprint(d['testingFeedback'][0][:40])\ndef walk(o):\n    if isinstance(o,dict):\n        for v in o.values(): yield from walk(v)\n    elif isinstance(o,list):\n        for v in o: yield from walk(v)\n    else: yield str(o)\nprint('exact unknown answers:', sum(1 for s in walk(d) if s.strip().lower()=='unknown'))\nprint(d['testingFeedback'][0][-210:])\nEOF\ngrep -c \"About 80. Scripts caught\" WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741.html","description":"Run kit checks, finalize notes, clean up, and verify the hand-in","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":437894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":940},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2ae2eb7-ae7f-44a8-ac16-77fd998e0107","uuid":"e5979270-bf49-49bf-b85e-20cd8267bade","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:28:18.277Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjd5VfUcaY7tAhRhGthV","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01J4vqSFRDzbphVP6cpqJ9Vg":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-230741__x6981e3/work/WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741\nHTML=../WeFitIn-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-230741.html\necho \"== newer than html:\"; find src tools -type f -newer \"$HTML\" | head\ntimeout 200 node check.mjs \"$HTML\" </dev/null > .scratch/check.log 2>&1; echo \"check.mjs exit $?\"\ntimeout 200 node check.mjs --sheets src/art/models.js </dev/null > .scratch/sheets.log 2>&1; echo \"sheets exit $?\"; grep -c \"0 problem(s), 0 warning(s)\" .scratch/sheets.l